      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It'd be even better if one could customize their leaving animation on their avatar. Some ideas that come to mind include:\n\n-\"change da world\" style fadeout \n\n-Tron style de-rezzolution\n\n-Star Trek transporter beam\n\n-Ready Player One style headset removal \n\nPlease note that's just off the top of my head.\n\nHaving strict audio and timing limits (e.g. 15 seconds max) would help with keeping the animations from getting obnoxious. A global toggle to turn all of them off (with possibly an exception for friends) would also be good.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
